		{"id":"ee0b923dd35afda0","type":"text","text":"|                       |                                                     |                                  |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |     |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| Metadata Intelligence | Metadata Inference                                  | cleaning label                   | clean_table_name.txt                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |     |\n|                       |                                                     | client inference                 | client_inference_system_prompt.txt  <br>client_inference_user_prompt.txt  <br>client_system_prompt_for_dq.txt  <br>reinfer_client_with_dq_context_system.txt  <br>reinfer_client_with_dq_context_user.txt                                   |     |\n|                       |                                                     | table inference                  | table_inference_system_prompt.txt  <br>table_inference_user_prompt_with_full_context.txt  <br>table_inference_user_prompt_with_source_context.txt  <br>reinfer_table_with_dq_context_system.txt  <br>reinfer_table_with_dq_context_user.txt |     |\n|                       |                                                     | column inference                 | column_inference_system.txt  <br>column_inference_user.txt                                                                                                                                                                                  |     |\n|                       |                                                     | source inference                 | source_inference_system_prompt.txt  <br>source_inference_user_prompt.txt  <br>reinfer_source_with_dq_context_system.txt  <br>reinfer_source_with_dq_context_user.txt                                                                        |     |\n|                       |                                                     | Ontology inference               | ontology_based_dq_rules_prompt.txt  <br>ontology_prompt.txt                                                                                                                                                                                 |     |\n|                       |                                                     | relationship inference           | relationship_inference_system_prompt.txt                                                                                                                                                                                                    |     |\n|                       |                                                     | context from knowledge context   | context_generation_system_prompt.txt  <br>context_generation_user_prompt.txt                                                                                                                                                                |     |\n|                       |                                                     | cross source inference           | cross_source_relationship_inference_system_prompt.txt                                                                                                                                                                                       |     |\n|                       |                                                     | primary key generation           | primary_key_detection_system_prompt.txt  <br>primary_key_detection_user_prompt.txt                                                                                                                                                          |     |\n|                       |                                                     |                                  |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |     |\n|                       |                                                     |                                  |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |     |\n|                       | Unstructured metadata inference and Topic Labelling | Unstructured file meta inference | unstructured_llm_call.txt  <br>unstructured_llm_user_wrapper.txt                                                                                                                                                                            |     |\n|                       |                                                     | topic labelling                  | topic_labeling_system_prompt.txt  <br>topic_labeling_user_prompt.txt                                                                                                                                                                        |     |\n|                       |                                                     |                                  |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |     |\n|                       |                                                     |                                  |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |     |\n|                       |                                                     |                                  |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |     |\n|                       | Data quality Rules                                  | Validation generation            | all_scopes_user_prompt.txt  <br>azure_search_query_system.txt  <br>azure_search_query_user.txt  <br>cross_reference_user_prompt.txt  <br>cross_reference_validation_prompt.txt  <br>validation_generation.txt                               |     |\n|                       |                                                     | Predefined user rules            | predefined_rules.txt  <br>rule_parsing_system.txt                                                                                                                                                                                           |     |\n|                       |                                                     | Update Rule                      | fe_sql_generation_system.txt  <br>fe_sql_query_update.txt  <br>sql_metadata_extract_system.txt  <br>sql_metadata_extract_user.txt  <br>validation_rule_update.txt                                                                           |     |\n|                       |                                                     | Add Rule                         | rule_addition_prompt.txt  <br>rule_addition_user_enhanced.txt  <br>rule_parsing_system_addition.txt  <br>rule_parsing_system.txt                                                                                                            |     |\n","x":-3280,"y":87,"width":1650,"height":885},
		{"id":"0c78ce68b1a7f57d","type":"text","text":"1. DQ Agent base version framework is ready, enriching the system prompts and then needs review on result. ***(built base version of standalone framework)***\n2. Excel sheet. ***(tested out 18, 10 are mapped correctly, some are vauge business rules, some are due to embedding input)***\n3. **Attaching context added via conversation to column level** ***(deployed need to be tested)***\n4. Table inference with other tables context is done locally needs thorough testing and will update the status by EOD. ***(developed and needs to test the results)***\n5. **Re-infer DQ rules when new context is added.** ***(needs design discussion)***\n6. Table name refinement is completed and pushed to dev.*** (deployed and tested)***\n","x":-4960,"y":-1800,"width":660,"height":300},
